                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not one of the finest platformers. enemies camp the edge of the platform your coming from, they see you and run as far to that side as possible meaning you can be hit by enemies or spike pits up to 5 times before being properly grounded. then you get up the technical jump and wall jump sections its near on impossible(for me) as enemies respawn every 10 seconds. Sooo basically dont fail your next jump. Production quality overall is quite good, but some of the mechanics are attrocious.",
